---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Base
  title="How we get paid | Signal Advisory LLC"
  description="Carrier neutral by design, with disclosed compensation. How Signal Advisory is paid: advisory and TEM fees, supplier commissions, and full written disclosure before you sign."
>
  <Nav />

  <section class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-12 pt-24 md:px-10 md:pt-32">
    <p class="mb-4 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-stone">Transparency</p>
    <h1 class="display text-4xl font-light leading-[1.1] md:text-5xl">
      How we <em class="text-signal not-italic font-medium">get paid.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
      Most firms in this industry call themselves independent and stop there. Here is the actual answer.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 md:px-10">
    <div class="space-y-10">
      <div class="border-t border-ink/10 pt-8">
        <h2 class="display text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Advisory and TEM fees</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/75 leading-relaxed">
          You pay us directly: hourly, flat fee, monthly retainer, or contingency on recovered savings. These fees are published or quoted in writing before work begins.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-ink/10 pt-8">
        <h2 class="display text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Supplier commissions</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/75 leading-relaxed">
          When we place a service with a carrier or technology supplier, that supplier typically pays us a commission through our distribution partnerships. This does not increase your price. Carriers pay the same commission whether an agent is involved or not. We disclose in writing, before you sign, whether we are compensated on a recommendation and by whom.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-ink/10 pt-8">
        <h2 class="display text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Why this structure helps you</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/75 leading-relaxed">
          Supplier commissions let us keep management fees low for small and midmarket clients. The written disclosure keeps us honest: if every option on the table pays us roughly the same, the only reason to recommend one over another is that it is the right answer for you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-ink/10 pt-8">
        <h2 class="display text-2xl font-medium mb-3">What we will never do</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/75 leading-relaxed">
          We will not recommend a supplier because of compensation. We will not accept compensation we have not disclosed. We will not recommend a paid engagement unless we believe the savings or risk reduction justifies the fee.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 border-t border-ink/10 pt-10">
      <a href="/audit" class="inline-block rounded-sm bg-signal px-8 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-paper hover:bg-ink transition-colors">
        Send us one invoice →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Base>
